
### 1. Create a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Faida",
  "username": "faida",
  "password": "example123"
}

### 2. List all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### 3. Get one user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/1

### 4. Update a user's name using username
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/faida
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Faida Kulimushi"
}